<section id="A1" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix A </span>Equations</h2>

<div id="A1.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Pruning Score Calculation</span>.  Given node <math id="A1.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="n" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>n</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">n</annotation></semantics></math>, neighbors <math id="A1.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="N(n)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">N(n)</annotation></semantics></math>, and the weight of edge <math id="A1.p1.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="e_{nm}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>e</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>m</mi></mrow></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">e_{nm}</annotation></semantics></math>,</p>
<table id="A1.E1" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A1.E1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\text{PS}(n)=\max_{m\in N(n)}\left(e_{nm}\cdot\tau(e_{\text{eff}})\right)" display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mtext>PS</mtext><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><munder><mi>max</mi><mrow><mi>m</mi><mo>∈</mo><mrow><mi>N</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></munder><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><msub><mi>e</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>m</mi></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">⋅</mo><mrow><mi>τ</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>e</mi><mtext>eff</mtext></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\text{PS}(n)=\max_{m\in N(n)}\left(e_{nm}\cdot\tau(e_{\text{eff}})\right)</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(A1)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
</div>
<div id="A1.p2" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.p2.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.p2.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Normalized Discounted Cumulative Gain.</span>  nDCG rewards systems that rank relevant memories higher, calculated as</p>
<table id="A1.E2" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A1.E2.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\text{nDCG@}k=\frac{\text{DCG@}k}{\text{IDCG@}k}" display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mtext>nDCG@</mtext><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>k</mi></mrow><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mtext>DCG@</mtext><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>k</mi></mrow><mrow><mtext>IDCG@</mtext><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>k</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\text{nDCG@}k=\frac{\text{DCG@}k}{\text{IDCG@}k}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(A2)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A1.p2.2" class="ltx_p">where <math id="A1.p2.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\text{DCG@}k=\sum_{i=1}^{k}\frac{\text{rel}_{i}}{\log_{2}(i+1)}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mtext>DCG@</mtext><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>k</mi></mrow><mo rspace="0.111em">=</mo><mrow><msubsup><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>k</mi></msubsup><mfrac><msub><mtext>rel</mtext><mi>i</mi></msub><mrow><msub><mi>log</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\text{DCG@}k=\sum_{i=1}^{k}\frac{\text{rel}_{i}}{\log_{2}(i+1)}</annotation></semantics></math>and <math id="A1.p2.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\text{rel}_{i}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mtext>rel</mtext><mi>i</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\text{rel}_{i}</annotation></semantics></math> is the relevance score of the retrieved memory at position <span id="A1.p2.2.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">i</span>, and IDCG represents the ideal DCG if all relevant memories were retrieved in perfect order.</p>
</div>
<div id="A1.p3" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.p3.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.p3.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Win Rate</span>.  Given memory system <math id="A1.p3.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="S_{\text{mem}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>S</mi><mtext>mem</mtext></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">S_{\text{mem}}</annotation></semantics></math>,</p>
<table id="A1.E3" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A1.E3.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\text{WR}(S_{\text{mem}})=\frac{\text{number of wins}+0.5\cdot\text{number of ties}}{\text{total number of opportunities}}" display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mtext>WR</mtext><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>S</mi><mtext>mem</mtext></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mtext>number of wins</mtext><mo>+</mo><mrow><mn>0.5</mn><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">⋅</mo><mtext>number of ties</mtext></mrow></mrow><mtext>total number of opportunities</mtext></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\text{WR}(S_{\text{mem}})=\frac{\text{number of wins}+0.5\cdot\text{number of ties}}{\text{total number of opportunities}}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(A3)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
</div>
<div class="ltx_pagination ltx_role_newpage"></div>
</section>
<section id="A2" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix B </span>Algorithms</h2>

<figure id="alg1a" class="ltx_float ltx_float_algorithm ltx_framed ltx_framed_top">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_float"><span id="alg1a.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Algorithm B1</span> </span> Substance Filter</figcaption>
<div id="alg1a.4" class="ltx_listing ltx_framed ltx_framed_topbottom ltx_listing">
<div id="alg1.l1a" class="ltx_listingline">
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">1:</span>
            
            
          <span id="alg1.l1a.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">function</span> <span id="alg1.l1a.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_smallcaps">HasSubstance</span>(<math id="alg1.l1a.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="s_{new},G" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>s</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>e</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>w</mi></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><mi>G</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">s_{new},G</annotation></semantics></math>)

</div>
<div id="alg1.l2a" class="ltx_listingline">
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">2:</span>
            
            
            context <math id="alg1.l2a.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\leftarrow s_{new}+G.\text{core\_summary}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mrow><msub><mi>s</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>e</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>w</mi></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><mi>G</mi></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0.167em">.</mo><mtext>core_summary</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\leftarrow s_{new}+G.\text{core\_summary}</annotation></semantics></math>

</div>
<div id="alg1.l3a" class="ltx_listingline">
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">3:</span>
            
            
            prompt <math id="alg1.l3a.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\leftarrow" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\leftarrow</annotation></semantics></math> “Given the context, output 1 if the conversation has substance, else 0.”

</div>
<div id="alg1.l4a" class="ltx_listingline">
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">4:</span>
            
            
            result <math id="alg1.l4a.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\leftarrow\textsc{LLM}(prompt,context)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mrow><mtext class="ltx_font_smallcaps">LLM</mtext><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>r</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>o</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>m</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>p</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow><mo>,</mo><mrow><mi>c</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>o</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>n</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>t</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>e</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>x</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\leftarrow\textsc{LLM}(prompt,context)</annotation></semantics></math> <span id="alg1.l4a.2" class="ltx_text" style="float:right;"><math id="alg1.l4a.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\triangleright" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo>⊳</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\triangleright</annotation></semantics></math> e.g., Mistral-7B
</span>
</div>
<div id="alg1.l5a" class="ltx_listingline">
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">5:</span>
            
            
            <span id="alg1.l5a.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">return</span> result <math id="alg1.l5a.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="=1" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">=1</annotation></semantics></math>

</div>
<div id="alg1.l6a" class="ltx_listingline">
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">6:</span>
            
            
          <span id="alg1.l6a.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">end</span> <span id="alg1.l6a.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">function</span>
</div>
</div>
</figure>
<figure id="alg2a" class="ltx_float ltx_float_algorithm ltx_framed ltx_framed_top">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_float"><span id="alg2a.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Algorithm B2</span> </span> Redundancy Filter</figcaption>
<div id="alg2a.4" class="ltx_listing ltx_framed ltx_framed_topbottom ltx_listing">
<div id="alg2.l1a" class="ltx_listingline">
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">1:</span>
            
            
          <span id="alg2.l1a.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">function</span> <span id="alg2.l1a.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_smallcaps">DetermineRedundancy</span>(<math id="alg2.l1a.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="n_{new},G" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>n</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>e</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>w</mi></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><mi>G</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">n_{new},G</annotation></semantics></math>)

</div>
<div id="alg2.l2a" class="ltx_listingline">
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">2:</span>
            
            
            <math id="alg2.l2a.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="m^{+}\leftarrow\textsc{FindMostRedundant}(n_{new},G)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>m</mi><mo>+</mo></msup><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mrow><mtext class="ltx_font_smallcaps">FindMostRedundant</mtext><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>n</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>e</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>w</mi></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><mi>G</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">m^{+}\leftarrow\textsc{FindMostRedundant}(n_{new},G)</annotation></semantics></math>

</div>
<div id="alg2.l3a" class="ltx_listingline">
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">3:</span>
            
            
            <span id="alg2.l3a.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">if</span> <math id="alg2.l3a.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="m^{+}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msup><mi>m</mi><mo>+</mo></msup><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">m^{+}</annotation></semantics></math> is <span id="alg2.l3a.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">null</span> <span id="alg2.l3a.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">then</span>

</div>
<div id="alg2.l4a" class="ltx_listingline">
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">4:</span>
            
            
             <span id="alg2.l4a.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">return</span> ADD_NEW, <math id="alg2.l4a.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="n_{new}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>n</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>e</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>w</mi></mrow></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">n_{new}</annotation></semantics></math>

</div>
<div id="alg2.l5a" class="ltx_listingline">
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">5:</span>
            
            
            <span id="alg2.l5a.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">end</span> <span id="alg2.l5a.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">if</span>
</div>
<div id="alg2.l6a" class="ltx_listingline">
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">6:</span>
            
            
            <span id="alg2.l6a.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">if</span> <math id="alg2.l6a.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="m^{+}.\text{is\_paired}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>m</mi><mo>+</mo></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0.167em">.</mo><mtext>is_paired</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">m^{+}.\text{is\_paired}</annotation></semantics></math> is <span id="alg2.l6a.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">null</span> <span id="alg2.l6a.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">then</span>

</div>
<div id="alg2.l7a" class="ltx_listingline">
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">7:</span>
            
            
             <span id="alg2.l7a.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">return</span> PAIR_NEW, <math id="alg2.l7a.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="(n_{new},m^{+})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>n</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>e</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>w</mi></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><msup><mi>m</mi><mo>+</mo></msup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">(n_{new},m^{+})</annotation></semantics></math>

</div>
<div id="alg2.l8a" class="ltx_listingline">
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">8:</span>
            
            
            <span id="alg2.l8a.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">else</span>
</div>
<div id="alg2.l9a" class="ltx_listingline">
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">9:</span>
            
            
             <math id="alg2.l9a.m1" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="n_{j}\leftarrow G.\textsc{GetNode}(m^{+}.\text{is\_paired})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>n</mi><mi>j</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mi>G</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0.167em">.</mo><mtext class="ltx_font_smallcaps">GetNode</mtext><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msup><mi>m</mi><mo>+</mo></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0.167em">.</mo><mtext>is_paired</mtext><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">n_{j}\leftarrow G.\textsc{GetNode}(m^{+}.\text{is\_paired})</annotation></semantics></math>

</div>
<div id="alg2.l10a" class="ltx_listingline">
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">10:</span>
            
            
             <math id="alg2.l10a.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="n_{older}\leftarrow\textsc{SelectOlder}(m^{+},n_{j})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>n</mi><mrow><mi>o</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>l</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>d</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>e</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>r</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mrow><mtext class="ltx_font_smallcaps">SelectOlder</mtext><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msup><mi>m</mi><mo>+</mo></msup><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>n</mi><mi>j</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">n_{older}\leftarrow\textsc{SelectOlder}(m^{+},n_{j})</annotation></semantics></math>

</div>
<div id="alg2.l11a" class="ltx_listingline">
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">11:</span>
            
            
             <math id="alg2.l11a.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="n_{newer}\leftarrow\textsc{SelectNewer}(m^{+},n_{j})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>n</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>e</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>w</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>e</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>r</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mrow><mtext class="ltx_font_smallcaps">SelectNewer</mtext><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msup><mi>m</mi><mo>+</mo></msup><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>n</mi><mi>j</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">n_{newer}\leftarrow\textsc{SelectNewer}(m^{+},n_{j})</annotation></semantics></math>

</div>
<div id="alg2.l12a" class="ltx_listingline">
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">12:</span>
            
            
             <span id="alg2.l12a.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">return</span> REPLACE_AND_PAIR, <math id="alg2.l12a.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="(n_{new},n_{older},n_{newer})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>n</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>e</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>w</mi></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>n</mi><mrow><mi>o</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>l</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>d</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>e</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>r</mi></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>n</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>e</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>w</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>e</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>r</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">(n_{new},n_{older},n_{newer})</annotation></semantics></math>

</div>
<div id="alg2.l13a" class="ltx_listingline">
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">13:</span>
            
            
            <span id="alg2.l13a.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">end</span> <span id="alg2.l13a.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">if</span>
</div>
<div id="alg2.l14a" class="ltx_listingline">
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">14:</span>
            
            
          <span id="alg2.l14a.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">end</span> <span id="alg2.l14a.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">function</span>
</div>
</div>
</figure>
<figure id="alg3" class="ltx_float ltx_float_algorithm ltx_framed ltx_framed_top">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_float"><span id="alg3.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Algorithm B3</span> </span> Start Node Selection</figcaption>
<div id="alg3.4" class="ltx_listing ltx_framed ltx_framed_topbottom ltx_listing">
<div id="alg3.l1" class="ltx_listingline">
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">1:</span>
            
            
          <span id="alg3.l1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Input:</span> Query <math id="alg3.l1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="q" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>q</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">q</annotation></semantics></math>, Memory graph <math id="alg3.l1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="G" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>G</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">G</annotation></semantics></math>

</div>
<div id="alg3.l2" class="ltx_listingline">
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">2:</span>
            
            
          <span id="alg3.l2.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Output:</span> Start node <math id="alg3.l2.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="n_{best}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>n</mi><mrow><mi>b</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>e</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>s</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">n_{best}</annotation></semantics></math>

</div>
<div id="alg3.l3" class="ltx_listingline">
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">3:</span>
            
            
          <span id="alg3.l3.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">function</span> <span id="alg3.l3.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_smallcaps">SelectStartNode</span>(<math id="alg3.l3.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="q,G" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>q</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>G</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">q,G</annotation></semantics></math>)

</div>
<div id="alg3.l4" class="ltx_listingline">
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">4:</span>
            
            
            <math id="alg3.l4.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="n_{best}\leftarrow\textbf{null}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>n</mi><mrow><mi>b</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>e</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>s</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_bold">null</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">n_{best}\leftarrow\textbf{null}</annotation></semantics></math>

</div>
<div id="alg3.l5" class="ltx_listingline">
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">5:</span>
            
            
            <math id="alg3.l5.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="s_{max}\leftarrow-1" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>s</mi><mrow><mi>m</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>a</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">s_{max}\leftarrow-1</annotation></semantics></math>

</div>
<div id="alg3.l6" class="ltx_listingline">
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">6:</span>
            
            
            <span id="alg3.l6.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">for</span> each node <math id="alg3.l6.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="n_{i}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>n</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">n_{i}</annotation></semantics></math> in <math id="alg3.l6.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="G" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>G</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">G</annotation></semantics></math> <span id="alg3.l6.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">do</span>

</div>
<div id="alg3.l7" class="ltx_listingline">
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">7:</span>
            
            
             <math id="alg3.l7.m1" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="s_{summary}\leftarrow\textsc{CosineSimilarity}(q.\text{embedding},n_{i}.\text{embedding})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>s</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>u</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>m</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>m</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>a</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>r</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>y</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mtext class="ltx_font_smallcaps">CosineSimilarity</mtext><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>q</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0.167em">.</mo><mtext>embedding</mtext><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>n</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0.167em">.</mo><mtext>embedding</mtext><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">s_{summary}\leftarrow\textsc{CosineSimilarity}(q.\text{embedding},n_{i}.\text{embedding})</annotation></semantics></math>

</div>
<div id="alg3.l8" class="ltx_listingline">
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">8:</span>
            
            
             <math id="alg3.l8.m1" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="s_{meta}\leftarrow\textsc{CosineSimilarity}(q.\text{embedding},n_{i}.\text{meta\_embedding})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>s</mi><mrow><mi>m</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>e</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>t</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>a</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mtext class="ltx_font_smallcaps">CosineSimilarity</mtext><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>q</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0.167em">.</mo><mtext>embedding</mtext><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>n</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0.167em">.</mo><mtext>meta_embedding</mtext><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">s_{meta}\leftarrow\textsc{CosineSimilarity}(q.\text{embedding},n_{i}.\text{meta\_embedding})</annotation></semantics></math>

</div>
<div id="alg3.l9" class="ltx_listingline">
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">9:</span>
            
            
             <math id="alg3.l9.m1" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="\alpha_{\text{meta}}\leftarrow\textsc{CalculateAlpha}(n_{i}.\text{age})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>α</mi><mtext>meta</mtext></msub><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mtext class="ltx_font_smallcaps">CalculateAlpha</mtext><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>n</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0.167em">.</mo><mtext>age</mtext><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\alpha_{\text{meta}}\leftarrow\textsc{CalculateAlpha}(n_{i}.\text{age})</annotation></semantics></math> <span id="alg3.l9.2" class="ltx_text" style="float:right;"><math id="alg3.l9.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\triangleright" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo>⊳</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\triangleright</annotation></semantics></math> <math id="alg3.l9.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\alpha_{\text{meta}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>α</mi><mtext>meta</mtext></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\alpha_{\text{meta}}</annotation></semantics></math> increases with age
</span>
</div>
<div id="alg3.l10" class="ltx_listingline">
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">10:</span>
            
            
             <math id="alg3.l10.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="s_{total}\leftarrow\alpha_{\text{meta}}s_{meta}+(1-\alpha_{\text{meta}})s_{summary}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>s</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>o</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>t</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>a</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>l</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>α</mi><mtext>meta</mtext></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>s</mi><mrow><mi>m</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>e</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>t</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>a</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>α</mi><mtext>meta</mtext></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>s</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>u</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>m</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>m</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>a</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>r</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>y</mi></mrow></msub></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">s_{total}\leftarrow\alpha_{\text{meta}}s_{meta}+(1-\alpha_{\text{meta}})s_{summary}</annotation></semantics></math>

</div>
<div id="alg3.l11" class="ltx_listingline">
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">11:</span>
            
            
             <span id="alg3.l11.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">if</span> <math id="alg3.l11.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="s_{total}&gt;s_{max}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>s</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>o</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>t</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>a</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>l</mi></mrow></msub><mo>&gt;</mo><msub><mi>s</mi><mrow><mi>m</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>a</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">s_{total}&gt;s_{max}</annotation></semantics></math> <span id="alg3.l11.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">then</span>

</div>
<div id="alg3.l12" class="ltx_listingline">
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">12:</span>
            
            
               <math id="alg3.l12.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="s_{max}\leftarrow s_{total}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>s</mi><mrow><mi>m</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>a</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><msub><mi>s</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>o</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>t</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>a</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>l</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">s_{max}\leftarrow s_{total}</annotation></semantics></math>

</div>
<div id="alg3.l13" class="ltx_listingline">
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">13:</span>
            
            
               <math id="alg3.l13.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="n_{best}\leftarrow n_{i}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>n</mi><mrow><mi>b</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>e</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>s</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><msub><mi>n</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">n_{best}\leftarrow n_{i}</annotation></semantics></math>

</div>
<div id="alg3.l14" class="ltx_listingline">
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">14:</span>
            
            
             <span id="alg3.l14.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">end</span> <span id="alg3.l14.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">if</span>
</div>
<div id="alg3.l15" class="ltx_listingline">
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">15:</span>
            
            
            <span id="alg3.l15.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">end</span> <span id="alg3.l15.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">for</span>
</div>
<div id="alg3.l16" class="ltx_listingline">
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">16:</span>
            
            
            <span id="alg3.l16.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">return</span> <math id="alg3.l16.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="n_{best}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>n</mi><mrow><mi>b</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>e</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>s</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">n_{best}</annotation></semantics></math>

</div>
<div id="alg3.l17" class="ltx_listingline">
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">17:</span>
            
            
          <span id="alg3.l17.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">end</span> <span id="alg3.l17.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">function</span>
</div>
</div>
